WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Great people everywhere

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,720
I wasn't cruel then

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,000
If the treasure is not accurate, it will be killed.

4
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:07,850
Didn't see it

5
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,050
I thought you were just a simple-minded gangster.

6
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,250
Just kidding

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,060
I'm a ten-year veteran

8
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,300
How could he be a bad person?

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,220
Veteran’s BBQ is not open for free

10
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,060
I have the best reputation here

11
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:37,180
I guess I blamed you wrongly, Brother Lin.

12
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:38,540
What should we do next

13
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,860
The last great man cannot be found now

14
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:41,900
Then find a way first

15
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:44,870
Find some handy weapons or food by the way

16
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:46,430
Can't sit here and wait to die
